title: 'statement-store: benchmark routing targets and retention affinity of the v2 topology'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    A criterion benchmark for the per-statement decisions of the v2 DHT topology: the forwarding
    targets of a topic and the local node's retention affinity. The topology types are
    re-exported, hidden from the docs without the test-helpers feature, so the benchmark can build
    them.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
